    "insight": "<p>Connect country circles, compare local lessons and invite education partners. Carry only agreed proposals upward; return clear answers to the participating groups. The EU circle is a citizen network proposal, not an EU institution. World cooperation is a later peer network, without an eighth pilot topic or a central authority over communes.</p><p><strong>A first small step</strong> Compare two documented local pilots from different countries and publish the questions that need shared support.</p><p>An educational example, not an appointed representative, active partnership or official embassy. Elections, membership checks, moderation and meeting booking are proposed; this page does not implement them.</p>",
